---
// Figure for the stocks-basics series, Post 8 (macro and industry). Numbers are from the sources cited in the post.
import DiagramIcon from './DiagramIcon.astro';
const W = 900;
const H = 312;
---
<figure class="sbp8-sbp08topdownlayers">
  <div class="sc">
    <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Three layers to read, from the economy to an industry to one company, with the VN-Index weights of banks (35%) and real estate (18%).">
      <text x="20" y="28" class="t"><tspan data-lang-en>Read from the top: economy, then industry, then the company</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Đọc từ trên xuống: nền kinh tế, rồi ngành, rồi mới tới công ty</tspan></text>
<rect x="20" y="52" width="260" height="130" rx="10" class="cardk" />
      <DiagramIcon name="bank" x={50} y={80} size={26} />
      <text x="76" y="86" class="h"><tspan data-lang-en>Economy</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Nền kinh tế</tspan></text>
      <text x="38" y="116" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>• Policy rate, inflation</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>• Lãi suất điều hành, lạm phát</tspan></text>
      <text x="38" y="138" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>• Exchange rate (USD/VND)</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>• Tỷ giá USD/VND</tspan></text>
      <text x="38" y="160" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>• Credit growth</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>• Tăng trưởng tín dụng</tspan></text>
      <rect x="320" y="52" width="260" height="130" rx="10" class="cardk" />
      <DiagramIcon name="network" x={350} y={80} size={26} />
      <text x="376" y="86" class="h"><tspan data-lang-en>Industry</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Ngành</tspan></text>
      <text x="338" y="116" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>• Banks, property, steel</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>• Ngân hàng, bất động sản, thép</tspan></text>
      <text x="338" y="138" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>• Exporters, importers</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>• Xuất khẩu, nhập khẩu</tspan></text>
      <text x="338" y="160" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>• Staples, utilities</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>• Hàng thiết yếu, tiện ích</tspan></text>
      <rect x="620" y="52" width="260" height="130" rx="10" class="cardg" />
      <DiagramIcon name="file" x={650} y={80} size={26} />
      <text x="676" y="86" class="h"><tspan data-lang-en>Company</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Doanh nghiệp</tspan></text>
      <text x="638" y="116" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>• EPS, ROE, debt (Posts 5-7)</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>• EPS, ROE, nợ (Bài 5-7)</tspan></text>
      <text x="638" y="138" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>• Where it sits in its own cycle</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>• Vị trí trong chu kỳ của chính nó</tspan></text>
      <text x="638" y="160" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>• Which exposure it carries</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>• Nó mang rủi ro nào</tspan></text>
      <line x1="282" y1="117" x2="308" y2="117" class="ln" /><polygon points="316,117 307,112 307,122" class="ah" />
      <line x1="582" y1="117" x2="608" y2="117" class="ln" /><polygon points="616,117 607,112 607,122" class="ah" />
      <text x="20" y="222" class="h"><tspan data-lang-en>Weights in the VN-Index (August 2023): two sectors carry more than half of it</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Tỷ trọng trong VN-Index (tháng 8/2023): hai ngành chiếm hơn một nửa chỉ số</tspan></text>
      <rect x="20" y="236" width="301.0" height="34" class="barg" />
      <rect x="321.0" y="236" width="154.79999999999998" height="34" class="bard" />
      <rect x="475.79999999999995" y="236" width="404.2" height="34" class="barm" />
      <text x="24" y="290" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>Banks 35%</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Ngân hàng 35%</tspan></text>
      <text x="325.0" y="290" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>Real estate 18%</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Bất động sản 18%</tspan></text>
      <text x="479.79999999999995" y="290" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>Everything else 47%</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Các ngành còn lại 47%</tspan></text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Sector weights are VinaCapital's figures quoted by The Investor (August 2023). When two sectors hold more than half of the index, a move in their cost of money moves the whole index.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Tỷ trọng ngành theo VinaCapital, do The Investor trích (tháng 8/2023). Khi hai ngành giữ hơn nửa chỉ số, chi phí vốn của hai ngành đó kéo cả chỉ số theo.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .sbp8-sbp08topdownlayers { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .sc { overflow-x: auto; }
  .sbp8-sbp08topdownlayers svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .sbp8-sbp08topdownlayers text { font-size: 12.5px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .sbp8-sbp08topdownlayers .t { font-size: 15.5px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .sbp8-sbp08topdownlayers .h { font-size: 13.5px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .sbp8-sbp08topdownlayers .b { font-size: 12.8px; }
  .sbp8-sbp08topdownlayers .m { fill: var(--text-muted); font-size: 12px; }
  .sbp8-sbp08topdownlayers .n { font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .sbp8-sbp08topdownlayers .red { fill: var(--red); font-weight: 700; }
  .sbp8-sbp08topdownlayers .grn { fill: var(--act-2); font-weight: 700; }
  .sbp8-sbp08topdownlayers .gld { fill: var(--gold); font-weight: 700; }
  .sbp8-sbp08topdownlayers .card { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .sbp8-sbp08topdownlayers .cardr { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.8; }
  .sbp8-sbp08topdownlayers .cardg { fill: var(--gold-tint-bg); stroke: var(--gold); stroke-width: 1.8; }
  .sbp8-sbp08topdownlayers .cardk { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--act-2); stroke-width: 1.8; }
  .sbp8-sbp08topdownlayers .ln { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.8; fill: none; }
  .sbp8-sbp08topdownlayers .lnr { stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 2.4; fill: none; }
  .sbp8-sbp08topdownlayers .lng { stroke: var(--gold); stroke-width: 2.4; fill: none; }
  .sbp8-sbp08topdownlayers .grid { stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1; fill: none; stroke-dasharray: 3 4; }
  .sbp8-sbp08topdownlayers .ah { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .sbp8-sbp08topdownlayers .barr { fill: var(--red); }
  .sbp8-sbp08topdownlayers .barg { fill: var(--act-2); }
  .sbp8-sbp08topdownlayers .barm { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .sbp8-sbp08topdownlayers .bard { fill: var(--gold); }
  .sbp8-sbp08topdownlayers figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
